# Kicked, The Eagles Are Coming! returns Bot1's two Spirit tokens from Lingering Souls and an Ornithopter. A token put into a
# hand ceases to exist (CR 111.8, 704.5d), so only the Ornithopter is in the hand afterwards, but each token was returned to
# Bot1's hand this way and still counts (the card's ruling): three Bird Soldiers come at the next upkeep.

